      "id": 1,
      "text": "In 1961, the Archdiocese of Mechelen was renamed the Archdiocese of Mechelen–Brussels during a national church restructuring.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
