        17,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archdiocese_of_Mechelen%E2%80%93Brussels"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Luc Terlinden became the archbishop in September 2023, succeeding his predecessor after a long vacancy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archdiocese_of_Mechelen%E2%80%93Brussels"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "English speakers once called the city Mechlin or Malines, but today the Dutch spelling Mechelen is standard.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
